# Runtime verification

Verify changes with observable runtime effects against the running application before finishing. Use any suitable available browser, HTTP, CLI, or debugging tools; no specific vendor or plugin is required.

Implement first, then verify. If verification reveals a problem, fix it and verify again. Documentation-only changes do not require application runtime checks.
